  "unreadable": [
    "Letter O vs digit 0 cannot be told apart in GPIO0, ADC1_0, ADC2_0, 5V0, U0RTS, U0CTS, U0RXD, U0TXD, FSPICS0, SUBSPICS0; read as 0. MTDO and the IO in FSPIIO/SPIIO read as letters."
  ],
  "uncertain": [],
  "notes": "Espressif 'ESP32-S3-DevKitM-1' pinout. Board silkscreen recorded first in functions when it differs. Functions listed outward from the pin; tags placed between the pin and the GPIO label (U0RXD, U0TXD, MTMS-MTCK, USB_D+/-) come first. 'RTC' power-domain tag kept as printed. Square pads (3V3, top-right G) are not treated as pin-1 marks. Skipped per rule 1: BOOT/RESET buttons, UART and USB connectors, RGB LED."
}